    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners OBrien Swaine are delighted to present this Exceptional 4-Bedroom Detached Bungalow in a Prime Countryside Setting\n\nSituated approximately 6km from Gorey and only a 15-minute drive to motorway access, this stunning four-bedroom bungalow offers the perfect blend of spacious family living, modern efficiency, and tranquil surroundings.\n\nApproached via a tarmacadam driveway, the property enjoys beautifully maintained lawned and shrubbed front garden, creating an attractive first impression. A double garage provides ample parking and storage, while practical external features include a covered laundry area, electric vehicle charging points, and outside water tap.\n\nTo the rear, a large private garden offers an ideal space for family enjoyment and outdoor entertaining. A generous patio area, perfectly suited for al fresco dining, is seamlessly connected to the kitchen and dining space through large double doors, allowing indoor and outdoor living to flow effortlessly.\n\nThe home has been designed with energy efficiency in mind and features premium Viking argon-filled glazing throughout. These high-performance windows offer superior insulation and efficiency, exceeding the performance of conventional triple glazing.\n\nAt the heart of the home is a bespoke fitted kitchen complete with quality cabinetry and a central island breakfast unit, creating a stylish and functional space for everyday living. The adjoining sitting room provides a welcoming family area, while double doors open into a spacious living room, offering flexibility for both relaxation and entertaining.\n\nThe accommodation comprises four generously sized bedrooms, including two with en-suite bathrooms, together with a well-appointed family bathroom. The thoughtful layout ensures comfort, privacy, and practicality for modern family life.\n\nAttic spaced is floored with stairs access for extra storage \n\nThis exceptional property presents a rare opportunity to acquire a beautifully maintained family home in a highly convenient yet peaceful location, within easy reach of Gorey and major transport routes.\n\nOutside \nTarmacadem Drive and front \nDouble Garage\nWired for Electric Gates \nZeppa 2 car charge\nType 1 Car Charge\nKey Lock\nBurner serviced\n Swing included \nSeptic Tank serviced\n\nServices \nSeptic Tank - Serviced this year \nWell water\nOil Burner serviced"
      },
